/-!
# KAMLunarLock

Root of the certificate application `KAMLunarLock`: SO-3: the Moon locked in synchronous rotation (N
= 65 librational torus). An opt-in library (decision D51): a plain `lake build` does not build it;
`lake build KAMLunarLock` does, through the serial capped driver. This file imports the generated
parts `KAMLunarLock.*`, which together import every module that `scripts/build_roots.json` assigns
to `KAMLunarLock`, except the frozen theorem anchors that are still `DRAFT_SORRY` and their provider
modules (built through the library's globs). It is generated by `scripts/gen_root_imports.py`; do
not edit it by hand, and never import it.
-/

